    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Tutanota is the world's most secure email service, easy to use and private by design. Sign up for free encrypted email now.

With end-to-end encryption and 2FA, your emails have never been more secure. The built-in encryption guarantees that your mailbox belongs to you: Nobody can decrypt or read your data.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Tutanota is an email client with a strong focus on security and privacy that lets you encrypt emails on all your devices.</summary>
    <releaseNotes># What's new
 - Introduce right click context menu [#10911](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/10911)
 - Mail Search Index Improvements
     - Chunk IPC calls for mail indexing [#11366](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11366)
     - Handle decryption errors gracefully [#11356](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11356)
     - Load Mail Attachments In Advance [#11355](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11355)
 - Introduce dedicated expand and collapse mail body buttons [#10913](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/10913)
 - Remove `[Tuta Mail]` prepended to mail subject for mails exported as MSG [#11224](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11224)

# Bugfixes
 - Prevent an alias from being activated on a deactivated user [#11195](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11195)
 - Mails failed to export due to client not respecting SuspensionError while downloading attachments [#11258](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11258)
 - Illegal key length: 0 when trying to recover deleted account [#11414](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11414)
 - Free users get error when creating 4th label [#11336](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11336)
 - [Search] filtering by subject field does not work [#11333](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11333)
 - Nested labels are sorted incorrectly [#11289](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11289)
 - Label counters show incorrect amount of unread emails [#11341](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11341)
 - Applying labels using shortcut on search view not working [#11078](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11078)
 - Attachment bubble for inline image in quoted reply removed on editor change [#11127](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11127)
 - Drag and drop to nest a folder allows two folders with the same name to exist in the same parent folder [#11002](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11002)
 - Support form modal can be closed without prompt when pressing ESC, making you lose all progress [#9564](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/9564)

# Milestone
https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/milestone/440?closed=1


